# Cori-Steel Cutter: "Flurry - Whenever you cast your second spell each turn, create a 1/1 white Monk creature token with
# prowess. You may attach this Equipment to it." and "Equipped creature gets +1/+1 and has trample and haste."
# Turn 3: Lightning Bolt is the first spell (no Monk), Mox Jet the second (one Monk, attached on Accept) and Mox Sapphire the
# third (no second Monk, but the Monk's prowess sees a noncreature spell: +1/+1). The Monk is a 2/2 with haste and trample,
# so it attacks the turn it arrives: with prowess 3 damage, and the Bolt's 3 is Bot2's life from 20 to 14.

